# #5837 V3 (a5e2e2ef, #5837 comment 6654623036): the split's marker view is read after the
# heads, possibly concurrently with the drain of its own appends.
MODULE: SiblingHintHonestSplitViewBeforeHeads
TARGET: SiblingHintHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the marker view is read before the split captures its heads
PERTURBS: SplitView
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithSplitHint = TRUE, WithViewOverlap = TRUE, WithDuplicate = FALSE, WithMixedVersion = FALSE

--- FIND
    /\ WithViewOverlap
    /\ a \in up
    /\ sh[a] # -1
--- REPLACE
    /\ WithViewOverlap
    /\ a \in up
\* MUTATION: no ordering against the heads.
--- END
